          "whatsNew": {
            "en-US": "Money moved between your own accounts can now be recorded as what it is. Open the add sheet and tap \"Between my accounts\": say where it came out of and where it went into, and both sides are written and linked. Nothing about it counts as spending, and nothing counts as income.\n\nThis matters most for money sent to an account no bank texts this phone about. Until now the app saw the payment leaving and nothing arriving, so it filed the whole amount as spending that never happened.\n\nSettling a card"
          }
        },
